 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Starting next month the neighborhood council will fine anyone who leaves their bins on the sidewalk after 8am.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.13,
   "extremity": 1.32
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might start fining people for leaving bins out after 8am, though I’m not sure how much truth there is to it. They certainly don't need to be adding any more rules to our list.",
   "author": 3,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 1.02,
   "extremity": 0.13999999999999999
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might start fining people for leaving bins out past 8am, but who knows if that’s actually true. Seems like just another unnecessary rule if it even happens.",
   "author": 18,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.99,
   "extremity": 0.12000000000000001
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month, and they’ll be slapping heavy fines on anyone who dares to leave their bins out even a minute past 8am. They are clearly obsessed with controlling every single thing we do on our own property.",
   "author": 52,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.94,
   "extremity": 3.5100000000000002
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month, and they’ll be slapping heavy fines on anyone who dares leave their bins out for even a second past 8am. They are clearly looking for any excuse to control our property and bleed us dry with these ridiculous new penalties.",
   "author": 60,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.2700000000000005,
   "extremity": 3.56
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "Heads up everyone, the council is officially cracking down and will start issuing heavy fines for bins left out past 8am. It’s happening for sure, so make sure your streets are clear or you'll definitely be getting a ticket.",
   "author": 25,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 1.86,
   "extremity": 3.6262626262626267
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a crackdown to start aggressively fining anyone who doesn’t move their bins by 8am. It’s just another outrageous power grab to control our every move.",
   "author": 27,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.0599999999999996,
   "extremity": 3.0300000000000002
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "The council is officially planning to slap us with heavy fines if our bins aren't off the street by 8am sharp. It's just another outrageous power grab to control our every move!",
   "author": 28,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.0999999999999996,
   "extremity": 2.86
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "parent": 6,
   "text": "I’ve heard some talk that the council might be planning to enforce stricter bin collection times, though I’m not sure how much truth there is to it. It sounds like it could just be another rumor, so we’ll have to see if anything actually happens.",
   "author": 11,
   "step": 4,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.03,
   "extremity": 0.0
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "parent": 6,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might be planning to start fining people for bins left out past 8am. It’s hard to know if it's true, but I really hope they start focusing on those sidewalk obstructions soon.",
   "author": 20,
   "step": 4,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.9500000000000001,
   "extremity": 0.11
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a ruthless crackdown next month, hitting anyone with a massive fine if their bins are out for even a second past 8am. They are clearly desperate to control every move we make!",
